; On GFX9+ AMDGPUCodeGenPrepare keeps a divergent i64 mul whose only user is an
; add as a plain mul, so the add combine fuses it into v_mad_u64_u32 or
; v_mad_i64_i32 instead of a mul24 + carry chain.

